            "heading": "Crystal-Clear Calling",
            "sub_heading": "Even in Bustling Environment",
            "description": "<p>Advanced noise cancellation technology ensures that your voice cuts through any background noise, delivering crystal-clear calls in any setting. Whether you're in a crowded café or on a noisy street, the built-in 4-mic system works seamlessly to filter out distractions.</p>",
            "title": "Crytal Clear Call"
          }
        },
        "image_zB3Qhk": {
